  "rationale": "248 units of Cream Bun 200G at Outlet 01 (North Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-15; doing nothing writes off ₹12576 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹10057. This play uses a bundle with SKU-FLAVOURED-MILK-200G at ₹100 for 476 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Tea connoisseurs, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 50 units, margin ₹438, discount cost ₹752, waste avoided ₹2544 (CI 3 to 146 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Cream Bun 200G with Flavoured Milk 200G at a bundle price of 100 INR, which satisfies the bakery category margin floor of 8.0% and aligns with the policy preference for bundles over markdowns. It reaches all consented customers across the candidate segments to maximize clearance before the expiry deadline.",
